---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="IA Right - AI Rights, Ethics & Artificial Intelligence News"
  description="Latest news on AI rights, artificial intelligence ethics, AI regulation, machine learning trends, AI safety research, and generative AI developments."
  lang="en"
>
  <Fragment slot="logo">IA Right</Fragment>
  <Fragment slot="footer-name">IA Right</Fragment>

  <section class="hero">
    <h1>AI Rights & Artificial Intelligence Ethics Hub</h1>
    <p>Your trusted source for AI rights news, artificial intelligence ethics, regulation updates, and the latest trends in machine learning and generative AI.</p>
  </section>

  <div class="ad-slot">Ad Space - Google AdSense</div>

  <div class="card-grid">
    <article class="card">
      <h2>AI Rights & Personhood</h2>
      <p>As AI systems grow more sophisticated, the debate over AI rights and legal personhood intensifies. Explore the philosophical and legal frameworks shaping the future of machine consciousness.</p>
    </article>
    <article class="card">
      <h2>AI Regulation & Governance</h2>
      <p>The EU AI Act, US executive orders, and global regulatory frameworks are defining how AI is governed. Stay updated on compliance requirements and policy developments worldwide.</p>
    </article>
    <article class="card">
      <h2>AI Safety & Alignment</h2>
      <p>Research into AI alignment, safety protocols, and existential risk mitigation is advancing rapidly. Discover the latest breakthroughs in making AI systems safe and beneficial.</p>
    </article>
    <article class="card">
      <h2>Generative AI Trends</h2>
      <p>From large language models to image and video generation, generative AI is transforming industries. Analysis of the latest models, capabilities, and ethical implications.</p>
    </article>
    <article class="card">
      <h2>Machine Learning Innovations</h2>
      <p>Breakthroughs in deep learning, reinforcement learning, and neural architectures are pushing the boundaries of what AI can achieve. Key research papers and industry applications.</p>
    </article>
    <article class="card">
      <h2>AI in Business & Society</h2>
      <p>How enterprises are adopting AI across healthcare, finance, education, and beyond. Impact analysis, workforce transformation, and strategies for responsible AI deployment.</p>
    </article>
  </div>

  <div class="ad-slot">Ad Space - Google AdSense</div>
</BaseLayout>
